<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank says pleased with crown development.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank says pleased with crown development.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said it was satisfied with recent crown fluctuations around its dollar/mark basket parity.</p>
<p>&quot;Basically we are pleased with this developement (fluctuation) since it works against speculative capital inflows and also creates a suitable environment for companies,&quot; NBS Vice-governor Marian Jusko told a news conference.</p>
</text>
